<title>SWITZERLAND: Soffex adds standard options on Clariant.</title>
<headline>Soffex adds standard options on Clariant.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss Options and Financial Futures Exchange said it would add standard options on registered shares of dyes and chemicals group Clariant AG as of December 6.</p>
<p>At the same time it will increase its menu of long-term options to include contracts for ABB bearer shares as well as for registered shares of Clariant, Alusuisse, Swiss Re, Winterthur and Zurich Insurance.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
